# Form: owner instruction

Use when an existing owner instruction cannot cover a distinct recurring responsibility.
Default output: `docs/instructions/<subject>.md`. First follow
[instruction authoring](../instructions/instruction-authoring.md.tmpl).
Copy payload only; fill agent placeholders and output-relative links per
[metadata](../../references/metadata.md). All main sections are essential; omit
optional commands/diagrams only if they add no value. A declared rule still needs
acceptance and a real route to its reader, not just a file on disk.

